{"exps":[{"para":{"tag":"tag_1"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara2"},"key":"top"},{"para":{"alpha":0,"scaleX":1.5,"trans":true,"layer":"bg","noOut":false,"noIn":false,"bright":1,"scaleY":1.5,"x":-500,"mirrow":false,"y":-125,"img":"bgblack","addImg":""},"key":"setLayer"},{"para":{"alpha":0.4,"scaleX":1.5,"trans":true,"layer":"bg","noOut":false,"noIn":false,"bright":1,"transTime":300,"scaleY":1.5,"x":-500,"mirrow":false,"y":-125,"img":"bgblack","addImg":""},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_2"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"alpha":0,"scaleX":1,"trans":true,"layer":"chara2","noOut":false,"noIn":false,"bright":1,"scaleY":1,"x":370,"mirrow":false,"y":-52,"img":"chara027_1","addImg":"chara027_1_face_chara027_1c"},"key":"setLayer"},{"para":{"alpha":1,"scaleX":1,"trans":true,"layer":"chara2","noOut":false,"noIn":false,"bright":1,"transTime":300,"scaleY":1,"x":370,"mirrow":false,"y":-52,"img":"chara027_1","addImg":"chara027_1_face_chara027_1c"},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"梅莉莉","text":"[show]你问我为什么钟情于侍者这个职业？[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_3"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"梅莉莉","text":"[show]嗯……具体原因我也说不清，但我想，可能是因为我喜欢“让他人感受到生活的美好”的这种感觉吧……[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_4"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara2","img":"chara027_1_face_chara027_1f"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"梅莉莉","text":"[show]深渊里的大家都很辛苦，每天要干很多活，还得时刻提防异变这种威胁。[r]哪怕是我们，有时都要兼任契约者，与魔物战斗，保护至亲好友。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_5"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara2","img":"chara027_1_face_chara027_1a"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"梅莉莉","text":"[show]所以……我希望每个需要照顾的人，都能在我们的支持下体验到慰藉和温暖。[r]哪怕只有片刻的放松也好。他们也值得感受生活的美好。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_6"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"梅莉莉","text":"[show]这就是我热爱侍者这个职业的原因。如果真有侍者之神，她一定会支持我的想法的！[l][cm]"},"key":"text"}],"des":"梅莉莉-熟识3","script":"yd_027_06"}